ole, and work is changing. I want you to feel it yourself. Ten days, on your real work.',\npil1T: 'Completely free',\npil1B: 'No credit card, nothing to cancel, no fine print. Just start.',\npil2T: 'Learns you',\npil2B: 'Not a demo. It works on your real tasks and learns your pace and style as you go.',\npil3T: 'A shared account',\npil3B: \"The pilot runs on one shared account, on me. There's a daily cap, so heavy use can slow the agent or pause it briefly. Fair use keeps it open for everyone.\",\npil4T: 'Finish and begin',\npil4B: \"After the ten days you set up your own Nanoclaw, with my agent guiding every step until it's live.\",\npilSoul: 'Yours, <span class=\"accent\">Elia Ben Cnaan</span>.',\nformH1: 'Your agent <span class=\"accent\">clocks in</span>',\nformLead: \"Your agent lives in Telegram, and that's where you'll work together, from your phone or your computer. A few more details and it gets going.\",\nformSoul: 'A minute of details, and your agent sends <span class=\"accent\">its first message</span>.',\ncta: [\n  { label:'Come meet your agent', action:'next', hint:true },\n  { label:'Wait, how safe is this?', action:'next' },\n  { label:\"Sounds safe, let's move on\", action:'next' },\n  { label:'Ten days? Count me in', action:'next' },\n  { label:\"Alright, let's get to work\", action:'submit' },\n],\ndemoGreeting: \"Hey, I'm Joni, your personal agent. Here's a workday with me.\",\ndemoClosing: \"And that's just a taste. Inside, we'll get into your actual work.\",\n```\n\nהערות קצרות:\n1. heroH1: היפכתי את הסדר. שורה ראשונה \"New hire starts today\" (21 תווים, נכנסת בשורה אחת ב-30px), וה-accent הוא \"Your AI agent\" הקצר. בסדר המקורי שורת ה-accent ‏\"Your AI agent starts today\" הייתה נשברת. אם חשוב לשמור על הסדר המקורי, החלופה: שורה ראשונה 'A new employee joined' עם accent שעלול להישבר בניידים צרים.\n2. heroLead ירד מ-235 ל-177 תווים, קרוב לנפח העברית (כ-200), עם אותם שלושה מהלכים: כולם מדברים, זה כבר קורה, אנחנו מלמדים אותך להיות ראשון. ויתרתי על \